GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the pay having advanced of Dvora on` `the date`
    MEANS `the monthly pay of` (`a teacher` WITH `qualification` IS `academic — holds a recognised second degree`, `seniority in years` IS 30, `rank` IS 8, `stage of education` IS `a primary school`, `fraction of a full post` IS 1, `first role` IS JUST `homeroom teacher of a first-grade class`, `second role` IS JUST `subject coordinator`, `classes in the coordinated grade level` IS 0, `units of the school-role supplement` IS 3) `the date` 130

