GIVETH A NUMBER
`the pay of Yael on half a post on` `the date`
    MEANS `the monthly pay of` (`a teacher` WITH `qualification` IS `academic — holds a recognised first degree`, `seniority in years` IS 11, `rank` IS 4, `stage of education` IS `a junior high school`, `fraction of a full post` IS 50%, `first role` IS JUST `homeroom teacher of a class other than the first grade`, `second role` IS NOTHING, `classes in the coordinated grade level` IS 0, `units of the school-role supplement` IS 0) `the date` 0

